height: 44px; font-size: 0.82rem; border: 1px solid #ef4444; color: #ef4444; background: transparent; font-weight: 600;"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrows-rotate"></i> Reset</button></div></div></div></section><section id="screen-contributors" class="screen hidden"><div class="dashboard-header animate-fade-in" style="margin-bottom: 28px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding-bottom: 16px;"><h2 class="section-title" style="font-size: 1.85rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin: 0;"><i class="fa-solid fa-users-gear" style="color: var(--accent-primary);"></i> Kontributor Proyek</h2><p class="section-subtitle" style="margin-top: 6px; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 700px; color: var(--text-secondary);">Apresiasi bagi para pengembang dan kontributor utama di balik layanan AlightMotion Generator.</p></div><div class="animate-fade-in" style="max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto;"><div class="glass-card plan-card" style="padding: 30px 24px; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;"><div style="font-size: 5rem; color: #fb7185; margin-bottom: 20px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-store"></i></div><h3 style="margin: 0 0 5px 0; color: var(--text-primary); font-size: 1.4rem;">Alwayscodex</h3><span class="badge badge-owner" style="background: rgba(251, 113, 133, 0.1); color: #fb7185; border: 1px solid rgba(251, 113, 133, 0.2); margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 0.85rem; padding: 6px 14px;">Project Owner & Base Store</span><p style="font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 0 0 25px 0;"> Pemilik proyek, penyedia layanan Codex Store, host server, integrasi pembayaran otomatis, serta pengelolaan sirkulasi API premium secara keseluruhan. </p><div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; width: 100%;"><a href="__BASE_URL__/" target="_blank" class="btn btn-secondary" style="flex: 1; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; padding: 