nt-size: 0.85rem;">Memuat obrolan...</p></div><form id="form-chat-send" style="display: flex; gap: 10px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding-top: 16px;"><input type="text" id="chat-input-text" placeholder="Tulis pesan Anda disini... (maksimal 300 karakter)" required maxlength="300" style="flex-grow: 1; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;"><button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" style="flex-shrink: 0; min-width: 100px;"><i class="fa-regular fa-paper-plane"></i> Kirim </button></form></div></section><section id="screen-apiguide" class="screen hidden" style="max-width: 100%; padding: 0;"><div class="docs-container"><aside class="docs-sidebar"><button class="docs-back-btn" id="btn-docs-back"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> Back to Dashboard</button><button class="docs-toggle-btn" id="btn-docs-toggle"><span><i class="fa-solid fa-list-ul"></i> Daftar Isi Dokumentasi</span><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down arrow"></i></button><div class="docs-sidebar-menu" id="docs-sidebar-menu"><div class="docs-nav-group"><div class="docs-nav-title">GETTING STARTED</div><button class="docs-nav-link active" data-doc="doc-intro"><i class="fa-solid fa-play"></i> Pendahuluan</button><button class="docs-nav-link" data-doc="doc-auth"><i class="fa-solid fa-key"></i> Otentikasi API</button></div><div class="docs-nav-group"><div class="docs-nav-title">LISENSI ENDPOINTS</div><button class="docs-nav-link" data-doc="doc-sendlink"><span class="method-badge post">POST</span> Send Link</button><button class="docs-nav-link" data-doc="doc-activate"><span class="method-badge post">POST</span> Activate</button><button class="docs-nav-link" data-doc="doc-integration"><i class="fa-solid fa-code"></i> Contoh Script Bot</button></div></div></aside><main class="docs-content"><div class="doc-section active" id="doc-intro"><h1 class="docs-title">API Reference</h1><p class="docs-desc">Selamat datang di dokumentasi API AM Premium Creator. Gunakan endpoint kami untuk membangun otomasi pada bot WhatsApp, Telegram, atau Discord Anda sendiri.</p><div class="docs-info-block" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 15px;"><div style="flex: 1;"><span class="info-label">BASE URL</span><div class="info-url" id="docs-base-url" style="word-break: break-all;">__BASE_URL__/api/v1/bot-premium?apikey=</div></div><button class="btn btn-secondary" id="btn-copy-base-url" style="padding: 6px 12px; font-size: 0.75rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); height: 35px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; white-space: nowrap;"><i class="fa-regular fa-copy"></i> Copy</button></div><h2>Alur Integrasi</h2><ol class="docs-steps-list"><li>Dapatkan API Key Anda di halaman <strong>Profil</strong>.</li><li>Gunakan endpoint <strong>Send Link</strong> untuk mengirimkan email verifikasi Alight Motion ke target.</li><li>Dapatkan tautan verifikasi dari email target, lalu kirimkan ke endpoint <strong>Activate</strong> untuk mengaktifkan status premium.</li></ol></div><div class="doc-section" id="doc-auth"><h1 class="docs-title">Otentikasi API</h1><p class="docs-desc">Semua request API wajib menyertakan autentikasi berbasis API Key. Jika key tidak valid atau masa aktif paket API Anda habis, server akan mengembalikan status error <code>401</code> atau <code>403</code>.</p><h2>Cara Pengiriman API Key</h2><p>Anda dapat mengirimkan API Key melalui tiga metode berikut (Metode Header sangat direkomendasikan):</p><table class="docs-params-table"><thead><tr><th>Metode</th><th>Key Parameter</th><th>Contoh Nilai</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>HTTP Header</strong></td><td><code>x-api-key</code></td><td><code>Codex_xxxxxx</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Query URL</strong></td><td><code>apikey</code></td><td><code>?apikey=Codex_xxxxxx</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>JSON Body</strong></td><td><code>apikey</code></td><td><code>{"apikey": "Codex_xxxxxx"}</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="doc-section" id="doc-sendlink"><h1 class="docs-title">Send Verification Link</h1><p class="docs-desc">Endpoint ini digunakan untuk mengirimkan link verifikasi lisensi Alight Motion ke email target. Setiap pemanggilan berhasil dari user non-admin akan memotong kredit sebanyak <strong>1 Kredit</strong>.</p><h2>HTTP Request</h2><div class="docs-endpoint"><span class="method-badge post">POST</span><code class="endpoint-path">/api/v1/bot-premium/send-link</code></div><h2>Request Body (JSON)</h2><table class="docs-params-table"><thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Tipe</th><th>Wajib</th><th>Deskripsi</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>email</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>Ya</td><td>Alamat email akun Alight Motion target.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="doc-section" id="doc-activate"><h1 class="docs-title">Activate Premium</h1><p class="docs-desc">Endpoint ini digunakan untuk menerapkan lisensi premium Alight Motion menggunakan email target dan link tautan verifikasi yang disalin dari inbox email target.</p><h2>HTTP Request</h2><div class="docs-endpoint"><span class="method-badge post">POST</span><code class="endpoint-path">/api/v1/bot-premium/activate</code></div><h2>Request Body (JSON)</h2><table class="docs-params-table"><thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Tipe</th><th>Wajib</th><th>Deskripsi</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>email</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>Ya</td><td>Alamat email akun Alight Motion target.</td></tr><tr><td><code>magicLink</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>Ya</td><td>Tautan tombol verifikasi (OOB code link) Alight Creative.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="doc-section" id="doc-integration"><h1 class="docs-title">Contoh Script Bot</h1><p class="docs-desc">Berikut adalah contoh script integrasi untuk bot WhatsApp/Telegram Anda yang menggunakan API kami (untuk role <strong>Auto Generator</strong> atau API Key Premium).</p><h2>1. settings.js</h2><p class="mb-3">Konfigurasikan API Key dan domain default Anda pada file settings bot:</p><div style="position: relative; margin-bottom: 25px;"><button class="btn btn-copy-code" data-target="code-settings-content"><i class="fa-regular fa-copy"></i> Copy</button> <pre><code class="language-javascript" id="code-settings-content">// settings.js
module.exports = {
    apiKey: "MASUKKAN_API_KEY_ANDA_DISINI",
    apiUrl: "__BASE_URL__/api",
    defaultDomain: "softbank.id"
};</code></pre> </div><h2>2. index.js</h2><p class="mb-3">Contoh kode NodeJS untuk mengotomatiskan pemanggilan API Generator Otomatis:</p><div style="position: relative;"><button class="btn btn-copy-code" data-target="code-index-content"><i class="fa-regular fa-copy"></i> Copy</button> <pre><code class="language-javascript" id="code-index-content">// index.js
const axios = require('axios');
const config = require('./settings');

async function generatePremiumAccount() {
    try {
        console.log("[Bot] Memulai batch generator otomatis...");
        
        // 1. Memulai batch 1 akun menggunakan domain pilihan
        const startRes = await axios.post(`${config.apiUrl}/am/autogen/start-batch`, {
            domain: config.defaultDomain,
            count: 1
        }, {
            headers: { 'x-api-key': config.apiKey }
        });

        if (!startRes.data.success) {
            throw new Error(startRes.data.error || "Gagal memulai batch.");
        }

        console.log("[Bot] Batch berhasil dimulai di server. Mulai memantau progres...");

        // 2. Lakukan polling status setiap 3 detik hingga selesai
        let completed = false;
        while (!completed) {
            await new Promise(resolve => setTimeout(resolve, 3000));

            const statusRes = await axios.get(`${config.apiUrl}/am/autogen/active-batch`, {
                headers: { 'x-api-key': config.apiKey }
            });

            const job = statusRes.data.job;
            if (!job) {
                console.log("[Bot] Tidak ada batch aktif.");
                break;
            }

            console.log(`[Bot] Status: ${job.status} | Berhasil: ${job.successfulCount}/${job.totalCount}`);

            if (job.status === 'completed' || job.status === 'failed') {
                completed = true;
                if (job.results && job.results.length > 0) {
                    const account = job.results[0];
                    console.log(`\n[Bot] GENERATE SUKSES!`);
                    console.log(`Email: ${account.email}`);
                    console.log(`Inbox: ${account.inbox}\n`);
                } else {
                    console.log(`[Bot] Pembuatan akun gagal.`);
                }
            }
        }
    } catch (error) {
        console.error("[Bot] Eror:", error.response ? error.response.data : error.message);
    }
}

generatePremiumAccount();</code></pre> </div></div></main><aside class="docs-code-panel"><div class="code-tabs"><button class="code-tab-btn active" data-lang="curl">cURL</button><button class="code-tab-btn" data-lang="nodejs">Node.js</button><button class="code-tab-btn" data-lang="python">Python</button><button class="code-tab-btn" data-lang="php">PHP</button></div><div class="code-content-wrapper"><div class="code-block-item active" id="code-curl" style="position: relative;"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 8px;"><span class="code-title">REQUEST • CURL</span><button class="btn btn-copy-code" data-target="code-curl-content"><i class="fa-regular fa-copy"></i> Copy</button></div> <pre><code class="language-bash" id="code-curl-content"># Contoh Request Send Link
curl -X POST __BASE_URL__/api/v1/bot-premium/send-link \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "x-api-key: __API_KEY__" \
  -d '{"email": "user@email.com"}'

# Contoh Request Activate Premium
curl -X POST __BASE_URL__/api/v1/bot-premium/activate \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "x-api-key: __API_KEY__" \
  -d '{"email": "user@email.com", "magicLink": "https://alightcreative.com/..."}'</code></pre> </div><div class="code-block-item" id="code-nodejs" style="position: relative;"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 8px;"><span class="code-title">REQUEST • NODEJS</span><button class="btn btn-copy-code" data-target="code-nodejs-content"><i class="fa-regular fa-copy"></i> Copy</button></div> <pre><code class="language-javascript" id="code-nodejs-content">const axios = require('axios');
const API_KEY = '__API_KEY__';
const BASE_URL = '__BASE_URL__/api/v1/bot-premium';

// 1. Mengirim Tautan Verifikasi
axios.post(`${BASE_URL}/send-link`, {
    email: 'target@email.com'
}, {
    headers: { 'x-api-key': API_KEY }
})
.then(res => console.log(res.data.message))
.catch(err => console.error(err.response.data.error));

// 2. Menerapkan Lisensi Premium
axios.post(`${BASE_URL}/activate`, {
    email: 'target@email.com',
    magicLink: 'https://alightcreative.com/...'
}, {
    headers: { 'x-api-key': API_KEY }
})
.then(res => console.log('Sukses!', res.data))
.catch(err => console.error(err.response.data.error));</code></pre> </div><div class="code-block-item" id="code-python" style="position: relative;"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 8px;"><span class="code-title">REQUEST • PYTHON</span><button class="btn btn-copy-code" data-target="code-python-content"><i class="fa-regular fa-copy"></i> Copy</button></div> <pre><code class="language-python" id="code-python-content">import requests

API_KEY = '__API_KEY__'
BASE_URL = '__BASE_URL__/api/v1/bot-premium'
headers = {'x-api-key': API_KEY}

# 1. Send Link
res = requests.post(f"{BASE_URL}/send-link", 
  json={"email": "target@email.com"}, 
  headers=headers
)
print(res.json())

# 2. Activate Lisensi
res2 = requests.post(f"{BASE_URL}/activate", 
  json={
    "email": "target@email.com", 
    "magicLink": "https://alightcreative.com/..."
  }, 
  headers=headers
)
print(res2.json())</code></pre> </div><div class="code-block-item" id="code-php" style="position: relative;"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 8px;"><span class="code-title">REQUEST • PHP</span><button class="btn btn-copy-code" data-target="code-php-content"><i class="fa-regular fa-copy"></i> Copy</button></div> <pre><code class="language-php" id="code-php-content">&lt;?php
$apiKey = '__API_KEY__';
$baseUrl = '__BASE_URL__/api/v1/bot-premium';

// Send Link Request
$ch = curl_init("$baseUrl/send-link");
curl_setopt($ch, CURLOPT_RETURNTRANSFER, true);
curl_setopt($ch, CURLOPT_POST, true);
curl_setopt($ch, CURLOPT_HTTPHEADER, [
    "Content-Type: application/json",
    "x-api-key: $apiKey"
]);
curl_setopt($ch, CURLOPT_POSTFIELDS, json_encode([
    "email" => "target@email.com"
]));
$response = curl_exec($ch);
echo $response;
curl_close($ch);
?&gt;</code></pre> </div></div></aside></div></section><section id="screen-admin" class="screen hidden"><div class="dashboard-header animate-fade-in" style="margin-bottom: 28px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding-bottom: 16px;"><h2 class="section-title" style="font-size: 1.85rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin: 0;"><i class="fa-solid fa-screwdriver-wrench" style="color: var(--accent-primary);"></i> Dashboard Administrator</h2><p class="section-subtitle" style="margin-top: 6px; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 700px; color: var(--text-secondary);">Kelola anggota terdaftar, pantau log aktivitas sistem global, serta kelola transaksi pembayaran QRIS.</p></div><div class="admin-stats-grid"><div class="glass-card stat-card"><i class="fa-solid fa-users stat-icon text-white"></i><div><div class="stat-value" id="stat-admin-total-users">0</div><div class="stat-label">Total Anggota</div></div></div><div class="glass-card stat-card"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line stat-icon text-white"></i><div><div class="stat-value" id="stat-total-activations">0</div><div class="stat-label">Total Request</div></div></div><div class="glass-card stat-card"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check stat-icon text-white"></i><div><div class="stat-value" id="stat-success-activations">0</div><div class="stat-label">Berhasil</div></div></div><div class="glass-card stat-card"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-xmark stat-icon text-white"></i><div><div class="stat-value" id="stat-failed-activations">0</div><div class="stat-label">Gagal</div></div></div></div><div class="admin-grid mt-4"><div class="glass-card table-card" id="admin-users-card"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px;"><h3 class="card-title" style="margin: 0;"><i class="fa-solid fa-users-gear"></i> Daftar Anggota</h3><div style="display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;"><button id="btn-admin-reset-credits" class="btn btn-warning btn-sm" style="font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 600; padding: 6px 12px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-rotate"></i> Reset Semua Kredit (50)</button><div style="position: relative; width: 100%; max-width: 180px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass" style="position: absolute; left: 12px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.85rem;"></i><input type="text" id="admin-search-users" placeholder="Cari username..." style="width: 100%; padding: 6px 10px 6px 34px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); font-size: 0.82rem; font-family: var(--font-primary); background: transparent; color: var(--text-primary);"></div></div></div><div class="table-responsive"><table><thead><tr><th>Username</th><th>Level</th><th>Kredit</th><th>OS / Perangkat</th><th>Status</th><th>Tindakan</th></tr></thead><tbody id="admin-users-table-body"><tr><td colspan="5" class="text-center">Memuat pengguna...</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div id="admin-users-pagination" class="pagination-container mt-3"></div></div><div class="glass-card table-card" id="admin-logs-card"><h3 class="card-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-list-check"></i> Log Aktivasi Global</h3><div class="table-responsive"><table><thead><tr><th>Waktu</th><th>Operator</th><th>Target Email</th><th>Status</th><th>Keterangan</th></tr></thead><tbody id="admin-logs-table-body"><tr><td colspan="5" class="text-center">Memuat data log global...</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div id="admin-logs-pagination" class="pagination-container mt-3"></div></div></div><div class="glass-card table-card mt-4" id="admin-transactions-card"><h3 class="card-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-receipt"></i> Transaksi QRIS & Pembayaran</h3><div class="table-responsive"><table><thead><tr><th>Tanggal & Waktu</th><th>Username</th><th>Referensi (Ref No)</th><th>Nominal</th><th>Plan</th><th>Status</th><th>Tindakan</th></tr></thead><tbody id="admin-transactions-table-body"><tr><td colspan="7" class="text-center">Memuat transaksi pembayaran...</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div id="admin-transactions-pagination" class="pagination-container mt-3"></div></div><div class="admin-grid mt-4"><div class="glass-card table-card" id="admin-ips-card"><h3 class="card-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-network-wired"></i> IP Anggota & Pembersihan</h3><p style="margin: 6px 0 0 0; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">Maksimal 3 akun per IP. Registrasi ke-4 dari IP yang sama otomatis ditolak.</p><div style="margin-bottom: 15px;"><button class="btn btn-danger btn-sm" id="btn-cleanup-ry-users"><i class="fa-solid fa-broom"></i> Bersihkan Akun ry_ </button></div><div class="table-responsive"><table><thead><tr><th>Username</th><th>Level</th><th>Alamat IP</th><th>Perangkat</th><th>Jumlah Akun</th><th>Tindakan</th></tr></thead><tbody id="admin-ips-table-body"><tr><td colspan="5" class="text-center">Memuat alamat IP dan perangkat...</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div id="admin-ips-pagination" class="pagination-container mt-3"></div></div><div class="glass-card table-card" id="admin-banned-ips-card"><h3 class="card-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-ban"></i> IP Terblokir</h3><div style="margin-bottom: 15px; display: flex; gap: 8px;"><input type="text" id="input-ban-ip" placeholder="Masukkan IP untuk diblokir..." style="flex: 1; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); font-size: 0.85rem; background: transparent; color: var(--text-primary);"><button class="btn btn-danger" id="btn-ban-ip-submit" style="padding: 6px 15px; font-size: 0.85rem;">Ban IP</button></div><div class="table-responsive"><table><thead><tr><th>IP Terblokir</th><th>Tanggal Blokir</th><th>Tindakan</th></tr></thead><tbody id="admin-banned-ips-table-body"><tr><td colspan="3" class="text-center">Memuat IP terblokir...</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class="glass-card table-card mt-4 animate-fade-in" id="admin-duplicates-card"><h3 class="card-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation" style="color: #f59e0b;"></i> Monitor Upaya Kloning Akun (Duplicate Attempt Logs)</h3><div class="console-box" style="background: #0f172a; border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 16px; font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #38bdf8; max-height: 250px; overflow-y: auto; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); box-shadow: inset 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);"><div id="duplicate-logs-container" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;"><div style="color: #64748b;">Memuat log percobaan duplikasi...</div></div></div></div></section><section id="screen-settings" class="screen hidden"><div class="dashboard-header animate-fade-in" style="margin-bottom: 28px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding-bottom: 16px;"><h2 class="section-title" style="font-size: 1.85rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin: 0;"><i class="fa-solid fa-gears" style="color: var(--accent-primary);"></i> Pengaturan Fitur & Pemberitahuan</h2><p class="section-subtitle" style="margin-top: 6px; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 700px; color: var(--text-secondary);">Kelola status pemeliharaan (maintenance) fitur utama dan atur pengumuman/notifikasi sistem global secara real-time.</p></div><div class="admin-grid animate-fade-in" style="gap: 24px;"><div class="glass-card table-card" style="padding: 24px;"><h3 class="card-title" style="margin-bottom: 20px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-screwdriver-wrench"></i> Status Pemeliharaan Fitur</h3><form id="form-maintenance-settings" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02); padding-bottom: 12px;"><div><h4 style="margin: 0 0 4px 0; color: var(--text-primary); font-size: 0.95rem;">Alight Motion Generator</h4><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">Blokir request pembuatan/aktivasi premium Alight Motion.</p></div><label class="switch-toggle" style="position: relative; display: inline-block; width: 44px; height: 22px;"><input type="checkbox" id="maint-generator" style="opacity: 0; width: 0; height: 0;"><span class="slider-toggle" style="position: absolute; cursor: pointer; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; background-color: #475569; transition: .3s; border-radius: 22px;"></span></label></div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02); padding-bottom: 12px;"><div><h4 style="margin: 0 0 4px 0; color: var(--text-primary); font-size: 0.95rem;">Netflix Crack</h4><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">Blokir request pengambilan akun Netflix premium gratis.</p></div><label class="switch-toggle" style="position: relative; display: inline-block; width: 44px; height: 22px;"><input type="checkbox" id="maint-netflix" style="opacity: 0; width: 0; height: 0;"><span class="slider-toggle" style="position: absolute; cursor: pointer; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; background-color: #475569; transition: .3s; border-radius: 22px;"></span></label></div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02); padding-bottom: 12px;"><div><h4 style="margin: 0 0 4px 0; color: var(--text-primary); font-size: 0.95rem;">Global Chat Panel</h4><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">Nonaktifkan fitur mengirim dan membaca pesan chat global.</p></div><label class="switch-toggle" style="position: relative; display: inline-block; width: 44px; height: 22px;"><input type="checkbox" id="maint-chat" style="opacity: 0; width: 0; height: 0;"><span class="slider-toggle" style="position: absolute; cursor: pointer; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; background-color: #475569; transition: .3s; border-radius: 22px;"></span></label></div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02); padding-bottom: 12px;"><div><h4 style="margin: 0 0 4px 0; color: var(--text-primary); font-size: 0.95rem;">Pembelian API Key</h4><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">Nonaktifkan QRIS payment gateway untuk pembelian lisensi.</p></div><label class="switch-toggle" style="position: relative; display: inline-block; width: 44px; height: 22px;"><input type="checkbox" id="maint-purchase" style="opacity: 0; width: 0; height: 0;"><span class="slider-toggle" style="position: absolute; cursor: pointer; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; background-color: #475569; transition: .3s; border-radius: 22px;"></span></label></div><div style="display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; margin-top: 10px;"><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" id="btn-save-maintenance" style="font-weight: 600; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Simpan Pengaturan </button></div></form></div><div class="glass-card table-card" style="padding: 24px;"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px;"><h3 class="card-title" style="margin: 0;"><i class="fa-solid fa-bullhorn"></i> Pengumuman & Notifikasi</h3><button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" id="btn-admin-add-notif" style="font-weight: 600; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i> Tambah Baru </button></div><div class="table-responsive"><table><thead><tr><th>Judul / Tipe</th><th>Isi Pengumuman</th><th>Status</th><th>Tindakan</th></tr></thead><tbody id="admin-notifications-table-body"><tr><td colspan="4" class="text-center">Memuat pengumuman...</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></section><section id="screen-reviews" class="screen hidden"><div class="dashboard-header animate-fade-in" style="margin-bottom: 28px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding-bottom: 16px;"><h2 class="section-title" style="font-size: 1.85rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin: 0;"><i class="fa-solid fa-star" style="color: #f59e0b;"></i> Rating & Ulasan Layanan</h2><p class="section-subtitle" style="margin-top: 6px; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 700px; color: var(--text-secondary);">Apa kata pengguna lain tentang website generator dan layanan kami? Bagikan pengalaman berharga Anda di sini.</p></div><div class="admin-grid animate-fade-in" style="gap: 24px;"><div class="glass-card table-card" style="padding: 24px; height: fit-content;"><h3 class="card-title" style="margin-bottom: 20px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-pen-to-square"></i> Kirim Ulasan Anda</h3><div id="review-unauthenticated-notice" class="hidden text-center" style="padding: 20px 0; color: var(--text-secondary);"><i class="fa-solid fa-lock" style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--text-muted);"></i><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;">Anda harus masuk ke akun Anda untuk dapat mengirimkan ulasan.</p></div><form id="form-submit-review" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px;"><div><label style="display: block; font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 8px;">Rating Bintang</label><div class="rating-stars-interactive" style="display: flex; gap: 8px; font-size: 1.8rem; color: #475569;"><i class="fa-solid fa-star star-btn" data-value="1" style="cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s ease;"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star star-btn" data-value="2" style="cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s ease;"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star star-btn" data-value="3" style="cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s ease;"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star star-btn" data-value="4" style="cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s ease;"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star star-btn" data-value="5" style="cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s ease;"></i></div><input type="hidden" id="input-review-rating" value="0"></div><div><label for="input-review-comment" style="display: block; font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 8px;">Ulasan Anda</label><textarea id="input-review-comment" placeholder="Tuliskan pendapat, kritik, atau saran Anda..." style="width: 100%; height: 110px; background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.4); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 12px; color: var(--text-primary); font-size: 0.88rem; resize: none; outline: none; transition: border-color 0.2s ease;" required></textarea></div><div style="display: flex; justify-content: flex-end;"><button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" style="font-weight: 600; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-paper-plane"></i> Kirim Ulasan </button></div></form></div><div class="glass-card table-card" style="padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px; padding-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); flex-wrap: wrap;"><div style="text-align: center; min-width: 100px;"><h4 id="review-avg-rating" style="font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; color: var(--text-primary); line-height: 1;">0.0</h4><div class="avg-stars" style="color: #f59e0b; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: 6px;" id="review-avg-stars"><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i></div><p style="margin: 4px 0 0 0; font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-secondary);" id="review-total-count">0 Ulasan</p></div><div style="flex: 1; min-width: 200px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 0.78rem;"><span style="min-width: 35px; color: var(--text-secondary);">5 Bintang</span><div style="flex: 1; height: 6px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border-radius: 3px; overflow: hidden;"><div id="bar-5-star" style="width: 0%; height: 100%; background: #f59e0b; border-radius: 3px;"></div></div><span id="count-5-star" style="color: var(--text-secondary);">0%</span></div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 0.78rem;"><span style="min-width: 35px; color: var(--text-secondary);">4 Bintang</span><div style="flex: 1; height: 6px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border-radius: 3px; overflow: hidden;"><div id="bar-4-star" style="width: 0%; height: 100%; background: #f59e0b; border-radius: 3px;"></div></div><span id="count-4-star" style="color: var(--text-secondary);">0%</span></div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 0.78rem;"><span style="min-width: 35px; color: var(--text-secondary);">3 Bintang</span><div style="flex: 1; height: 6px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border-radius: 3px; overflow: hidden;"><div id="bar-3-star" style="width: 0%; height: 100%; background: #f59e0b; border-radius: 3px;"></div></div><span id="count-3-star" style="color: var(--text-secondary);">0%</span></div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 0.78rem;"><span style="min-width: 35px; color: var(--text-secondary);">2 Bintang</span><div style="flex: 1; height: 6px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border-radius: 3px; overflow: hidden;"><div id="bar-2-star" style="width: 0%; height: 100%; background: #f59e0b; border-radius: 3px;"></div></div><span id="count-2-star" style="color: var(--text-secondary);">0%</span></div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 0.78rem;"><span style="min-width: 35px; color: var(--text-secondary);">1 Bintang</span><div style="flex: 1; height: 6px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border-radius: 3px; overflow: hidden;"><div id="bar-1-star" style="width: 0%; height: 100%; background: #f59e0b; border-radius: 3px;"></div></div><span id="count-1-star" style="color: var(--text-secondary);">0%</span></div></div></div><div id="reviews-list-container" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; max-height: 400px; overflow-y: auto; padding-right: 4px;"><div style="color: var(--text-secondary);" class="text-center">Memuat ulasan...</div></div></div></div></section><footer class="main-footer"><p>&copy; 2026 AM Premium By Alwayscodex Project & <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029Vb8EfuN35fM5AX25AT1W" target="_blank" style="color: var(--accent-color); text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;">join channel Whatsapp</a></p></footer></main></div><div class="sidebar-overlay" id="sidebar-overlay"></div> <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/sweetalert2@11"></script> <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/prism.min.js"></script> <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/components/prism-bash.min.js"></script> <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/components/prism-javascript.min.js"></script> <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/components/prism-python.min.js"></script> <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/components/prism-php.min.js"></script> <script src="/js/home.js"></script>
